[I] Multilingual text database for the m17n input method library

[T] m17n-db provides the language, input method, character mapping and font
[T] layout table data used by the m17n-lib multilingual text processing library
[T] to support text input, display and conversion across many languages.

[U] https://www.nongnu.org/m17n/

[A] Kenichi Handa <handa@gnu.org>
[A] National Institute of Advanced Industrial Science and Technology (AIST)
